 "pages": "p.3 (pins), p.4-5 (ROC), p.10 (timing), p.32-34 (data rates), p.40-44 (modes, interface), p.45-48 (format, commands), p.49-53 (registers)",
 "notModeled": [
  "analog: PGA / buffer, input mux, reference selection (CONFIG1.REF), modulator (stored only); the result is the 0 V code",
  "digital filter stages, filter phase, HPF corner, and the 63-period settling after SYNC / reset / power-down / mode changes",
  "GPIO0/GPIO1: the GPIO register is stored only; the pins are never driven and GPIOx_DAT does not read the pin level (reset value xb modeled as 0)",
  "sample rate converter (SRC0/SRC1): stored only, the data rate is the nominal one",
  "conversion time = 1 / FIR data rate per power mode and DR (Table 7-4, fCLK 8.192 MHz high/mid, 4.096 MHz low power); the sinc-filter rates (FILTR = 01b, Table 7-3: 8-128 kSPS, half in low power) are not expressible together with the power mode (a third field)",
  "offset and gain calibration commands and the OFFSET/GAIN scaling of the result",
  "RDATA: the datasheet outputs 00h for the command byte when DRDY is high and restarts the data on byte 2; the model replies with the data right after the command byte",
  "DRDY returns high on the first SCLK falling edge of any transfer (modeled as clears on read) and pulses high for 8 fCLK when data are not read (clears on start)",
  "pulse-sync vs continuous-sync (ID_SYNC.SYNC); every SYNC rising edge restarts the conversion in the model",
  "REVID[3:0] is factory-programmed (reset xxxxb): modeled as 0",
  "CS-high-to-DOUT-Hi-Z delay is not specified (tFloat 0)",
  "IOVDD connected to CAPD (1.65-1.95 V) vs 2.7-3.6 V operation; vcc is their union"
 ],
 "variants": "own datasheet; the ADS1288 (own spec) is the low-power-only version with the same pinout and register map",
